		{
			dependencies: ["7D7C110000000001"]
			description: [
				"Craft the TaCZ Stone Statue yourself, then place your personal Core in the world. Click the single item task to open its recipe."
				""
				"Core survival rules begin when you complete this task by placing your statue. After that, a placed Core lets you respawn in Survival. Monsters and other players can damage it. If you move or lose it, your health slowly drains; carrying it drains more slowly. If you die without an active Core, you become a stationary spectator until another survivor restores it."
				""
				"Place your own Core to activate its survival rules. Claim the 3 wool for your bed from this quest's reward icon. Each player still needs to craft their own Core."
			]
			icon: "tacz:statue"
			id: "7D7C110000000009"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 3
					id: "7D7C1A0000000006"
					item: "minecraft:white_wool"
