			description: [
				"Build the four 7DTC workbenches at the Central Workbench (4 logs + 3 copper ingots each) and place all four near your Core. In a team, using a workbench someone else placed also counts."
				""
				"Weapons: melee, firearms and attachments. Armor: armor sets. Ordnance: ammo, explosives and turrets. Utility: components, tools and medicine."
				""
				"Each workbench upgrades twice. Level 2 needs Elite Mechanisms (dropped by elite zombies); level 3 needs a Boss Core (dropped by bosses). Hover any material to see where to find it."
